{
  "_help": "Team profiles shown ONLY when the live backend is unavailable. Ids must be unique negative numbers. weeklySlots lists the session start times per weekday (full English day names, 24h HH:mm, written in the profile's own timeZone); each slot lasts durationMinutes. A profile may set its own durationMinutes, otherwise defaultDurationMinutes applies. timeZone is REQUIRED per profile and must be an IANA time zone name in Area/City form, case-sensitive: Asia/Jakarta (WIB, UTC+7), Asia/Makassar (WITA, UTC+8), Asia/Jayapura (WIT, UTC+9), Asia/Singapore, Australia/Sydney. Do NOT use abbreviations or offsets such as WIB, GMT+7 or UTC+7. Daylight saving is handled automatically. Leave out acceptsCouple to mean false. photo: file name only of an image placed in public/team/ (see src/data/README.md); leave \"\" to use the default portrait. gender: \"FEMALE\", \"MALE\" or \"NEUTRAL\" (picks the default portrait shown when there is no photo; never shown on the site). practiceMode: \"ONLINE\", \"IN_PERSON\" or \"HYBRID\"; IN_PERSON and HYBRID need at least one entry in locations ({ \"label\", \"address\" }, the first is the main one). languages: list of names, e.g. [\"Bahasa Indonesia\", \"English\"]. yearsExperience / licenceNumber: null when unknown. sessionFeeCents / sessionFeeCurrency mirror the backend fields (IDR 500,000 = 50000000); the fee is kept for the team and is NOT shown on the website. translations.id (optional, per profile): Indonesian bio, areasOfExpertise and credentials, shown when the visitor reads the site in Bahasa Indonesia; the lists must have the same number of entries as the English ones, in the same order. Leave a field out to show the English text. DRAFT: the current Indonesian text was machine-drafted and still needs review by an Indonesian speaker on the team (see Website/QA-CHECKLIST.md F8).",
